<title>UK: March Brent programme 42 cargoes plus 1.93 mln bls.</title>
<headline>March Brent programme 42 cargoes plus 1.93 mln bls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The March North Sea Brent Blend crude oil loading programme has been set at the equivalent of 42 cargoes of 500,000 barrels and 1.93 million barrels in smaller top-up cargoes, traders said.</p>
<p>The March programme was up four from February's 38 standard cargoes plus 1.36 million barrels in topups.</p>
<p>Traders said the lower programme in February was due to the shorter month.</p>
<p>Crude from the Brent and Ninian systems is blended at Sullom Voe terminal on the Shetland Islands and exported as world benchmark Brent Blend.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
